  "updated_at": "2026-04-13",
  "bio": "Step into the creative haven of PaperCity Tattoo, nestled in the heart of Holyoke, where illustrative and exquisite black and gray ink come to life. Our doors at 1735 Northampton St. are open for walk-ins and piercings from 12 to 8 PM daily, ensuring that your vision for body art can become a reality at your convenience. Connect with our renowned resident artists @bruceleeharveyoswald and @stephensteel213 for a tattoo experience that's as remarkable as the piece you'll leave with.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Holyoke, Massachusetts, United States\n\nTattoos by appointment \nChicopee, MA\n(413)466.4639\nOpen 7 days a week!",
